    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_select_03",
      "hash64": "39BCA5ABE351F0B8",
      "text": "Wir müssen die Schalttafel nutzen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_select_04",
      "hash64": "39BCACABE351FC9D",
      "text": "Wir müssen das Tor entriegeln!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_brother_03",
      "hash64": "DDDCA95853B39E12",
      "text": "Krass, als wären wir Geheimagenten oder so...\\nVoll cool![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_brother_04",
      "hash64": "DDDCA45853B39593",
      "text": "Oh, äh... Ich hab nichts gesagt.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "6CA0E14B0F44D43D",
      "text": "Würdest du das Tor dann bitte für uns öffnen,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_sister_05",
      "hash64": "09E183BFBA114D26",
      "text": "Wenn du mich fragst, wär „Kristall-Labor“ ein\\npassenderer Name für den Schuppen gewesen.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_brother_05",
      "hash64": "DDDCA35853B393E0",
      "text": "Eine Schalttafel zum Entriegeln der Schlösser...\\nEcht genial... Äh, ich meine, ist mir echt egal!![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0252_bbteacher_07",
      "hash64": "6CA0E04B0F44D28A",
      "text": "Dürfte ich dich bitten, die Schalttafel zu\\nbetätigen, um das Tor zu entriegeln?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
